            this time.
          %h2#notions_of_subgraphs_from_the_npov Notions of subgraphs from the nPOV
          %p
            A usual definition of
            %em subgraph
            in combinatorics is, roughly:
            = succeed "." do
              %em subset
            %em undirected simple graph
            means
            = succeed "," do
              %em
                pair
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                      %mi V
                      %mo ,
                      %mi E
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (V,E)
                of two sets, with
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi E
